    "detailed_description": "It was a beautiful day on the beach, until the seagulls rose up. They kidnapped your sweetheart, and plan to take over the world! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/17717a12f917e32d884b1fafc11aab46.poster.avif?t=1705527596\" width=480 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/17717a12f917e32d884b1fafc11aab46.webm?t=1705527596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/17717a12f917e32d884b1fafc11aab46.mp4?t=1705527596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Kick, punch, and bash your way through hordes of seagulls! Defeat the seagull bosses at the end of each level! Stop the terrors of the beach from carrying out their devious plot to take over the world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/3d0af8a0d94ee774fdcd83abc9306946.poster.avif?t=1705527596\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/3d0af8a0d94ee774fdcd83abc9306946.webm?t=1705527596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/3d0af8a0d94ee774fdcd83abc9306946.mp4?t=1705527596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Do you have what it takes to stop the seagull hordes, rescue your boo, and save the world? Buy Seagull Wars and find out!",
    "about_the_game": "It was a beautiful day on the beach, until the seagulls rose up. They kidnapped your sweetheart, and plan to take over the world! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/17717a12f917e32d884b1fafc11aab46.poster.avif?t=1705527596\" width=480 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/17717a12f917e32d884b1fafc11aab46.webm?t=1705527596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/17717a12f917e32d884b1fafc11aab46.mp4?t=1705527596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Kick, punch, and bash your way through hordes of seagulls! Defeat the seagull bosses at the end of each level! Stop the terrors of the beach from carrying out their devious plot to take over the world!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/3d0af8a0d94ee774fdcd83abc9306946.poster.avif?t=1705527596\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/3d0af8a0d94ee774fdcd83abc9306946.webm?t=1705527596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705750/extras/3d0af8a0d94ee774fdcd83abc9306946.mp4?t=1705527596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Do you have what it takes to stop the seagull hordes, rescue your boo, and save the world? Buy Seagull Wars and find out!",
